message: "If you use these artifacts, please cite them as below."
title: "conv3x3-engine-zynq: runtime-programmable 3x3 convolution engine and fixed Sobel core for Zynq-7020 (reconstructed RTL, testbenches, golden model, Vivado reports)"
type: software
abstract: "Reconstructed Verilog RTL, testbenches, fixed-point golden model, and Vivado 2026.1 out-of-context scripts and reports (W = 160 and W = 1920) for a runtime-programmable 3x3 convolution engine and a fixed Sobel core on XC7Z020-1. No board-level runs; BSDS500 evaluation code not included."
